  "fullDescription": "Add a dose of cuteness to your designs with this charming Capybara Clipart PNG Collection! 🐹✨ This set includes 26 high-quality transparent PNGs featuring adorable capybaras in spring, birthday, Christmas, and nature themes — perfect for any creative project. You’ll find kawaii-style capybaras holding flowers, wearing party hats, swimming with goggles, and surrounded by colorful fish and plants.\n\nUse these versatile capybara PNGs for scrapbooking, spring clipart bundles, greeting cards, capybara birthday invitations, kawaii stickers, wall prints, or nature-inspired digital designs. Each element is crafted with a transparent background for easy layering in Canva, Procreate, Photoshop, or Cricut.\n\nWhether you’re making cute animal clipart collections, capybara Christmas cards, or nature-themed art, this bundle has everything to bring your vision to life. Perfect for both personal and commercial use!\n\n⸻\n\n📦 WHAT’S INCLUDED\n• 26 individual PNG files (transparent background)\n• High-resolution (216 DPI)\n• Nature, spring, birthday, and Christmas-themed capybara elements\n• Instant digital download\n\n⸻\n\n📜 COMMERCIAL LICENSE INCLUDED\nUse in unlimited commercial end products, both digital and physical. You may not resell the original files.\n\n🆔 Collection ID: CapybaraNature26",
